Bootstrap Icons (https://github.com/twbs/icons)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Provenance

`code-slash.svg` is vendored unmodified from the upstream `icons/` directory at
tag v1.13.2. It is the only file in this directory that does not come from
Material Icon Theme, which `MaterialIconTheme.LICENSE` covers.

It is the fallback icon of a code window whose language the theme ships no icon
for, and the same glyph Quarto gives its own `code-tools` button, so an
unrecognised language reads as code rather than as nothing.

Refresh procedure:

    gh api "repos/twbs/icons/contents/icons/code-slash.svg?ref=<tag>" \
      --jq '.content' | base64 -d > code-slash.svg

Update the tag recorded above whenever the file is refreshed.

The file keeps its upstream `fill="currentColor"`, which `code-icons.css` never
reads: that rule paints the glyph through `mask-image`, so it takes the text
colour of whichever surface it lands on, the title bar or the folded chip, in
both colour schemes.

